This is a male, and life here suits him well.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.150
Angroves provide all the leaves he can eat,

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.610
and there are no predators to worry him.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.960
Island life may seem idyllic, but it comes...

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:09.710
at a price there are only a few hundred pygmy sloths in existence and he needs

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:29.690
a mate an enticing call from a female somewhere out there and this

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.150
For a sloth, it's a quick reaction.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.980
The problem is, there's deep water.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:06.290
So, what should any red-blooded sloth do?

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.150
Swim, of course.

